OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles and Queen Camilla to
OL,4,Aofficially open Senedd as poet dropped
OL,5,Afrom ceremony
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla will
OL,8,Fofficially open the Senedd's seventh
OL,9,Fterm on Thursday during a visit to
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FIt will be the first time the monarch
OL,13,Fwill have visited the Welsh Parliament
OL,14,Fsince 2024, and the first official
OL,15,Fmeeting with Rhun ap Iorwerth since he
OL,16,Fbecame Wales' first minister.
OL,18,FThe visit comes as it emerged Wales'
OL,19,Fnational poet would not be taking part
OL,20,Fin ceremony as planned, after Senedd
OL,21,Fofficials rejected the poem she had
OL,22,Fwritten for the event.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
