OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles and Queen Camilla to
OL,4,Aofficially open Senedd as poet dropped
OL,5,Afrom ceremony
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles will give a speech to the
OL,8,FSenedd before meeting a number of
OL,9,Finvited guests, including 10-year-old
OL,10,FNoah Jones, whose great-grandfather
OL,11,Fsurvived the 1966 Aberfan coal tip
OL,12,Fdisaster.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
